# anthropic_deployment_runs (Data Source)

Lists the run history of scheduled deployments (beta). Each run records one attempt at starting a session: either the resulting `session_id` or the `error` that prevented session creation. Supports filtering by deployment, outcome and trigger type; all pages are fetched automatically.

> **API**: `GET /v1/deployment_runs` (Managed Agents API).
> **Auth**: Standard API key (`api_key` / `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY`).
> **Beta header**: `anthropic-beta: managed-agents-2026-04-01`.
> **Cost**: Free.

